        <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>不会发生过载，电流被限制在最大有效值电流以内</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 align-top">
        <th scope="row" class="bg-gray-50 py-3 px-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900">占地与安装</th>
        <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600">
