        <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>模块体积紧凑，占地小、安装简便，可利用现有开关柜</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr class="border-b border-gray-200 align-top">
        <th scope="row" class="bg-gray-50 py-3 px-4 text-left font-semibold text-gray-900">扩容</th>
        <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600">
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5">
          <li>受限，且取决于负载条件与电网拓扑</li>
          </ul>
        </td>
        <td class="py-3 px-4 text-gray-600">
